<Base title="Support" description="Get help with a Swarmnest purchase: download links, refunds, license questions and bugs. Email support@swarmnest.ai." path="/support/">
<h1>Support</h1>
<p class="lead">Help with a Swarmnest purchase, download or product.</p>
<p>Email <a href="mailto:support@swarmnest.ai?subject=Support%20request">support@swarmnest.ai</a>. Please include the email you used at checkout, the product name and your order reference (it is on your receipt). We aim to reply within 3 business days.</p>
<p class="small">For press, sponsorship, legal or copyright matters, use <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai">hello@swarmnest.ai</a> instead (see <a href="/takedown/">Takedown &amp; Corrections</a>).</p>

<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>Where Is My Download Link?</h3>
<p>After payment you are sent back to a confirmation page with your link, and we also email it to the address you used at checkout. The link works for 72 hours and up to 10 zip downloads. If it expires, open the confirmation page again from your receipt or email (its address ends with <code>?thanks=1&amp;session_id=...</code>) to get a fresh link. If it still fails, email support.</p>

<h3>How Do I Get a Refund?</h3>
<p>Contact us within 14 days of purchase if a product is defective, undelivered or not as described. We will fix it, replace it or refund you. Details are in the <a href="/refunds/">Refund Policy</a>.</p>

<h3>What Can I Do With a Product?</h3>
<p>One purchase covers one person, for personal and commercial use. You may not resell or share the files. See the <a href="/license/">Product License</a> and the <a href="/digital-products-disclaimer/">Digital Products Disclaimer</a>.</p>

<h3>A Script or Workflow Does Not Work</h3>
<p>Check the README and the TEST-EVIDENCE file in the download for what was tested and for setup steps. If it still fails, send us the product name, what you ran and the error message.</p>

<h3>My Card Statement Shows an Unknown Charge</h3>
<p>Swarmnest purchases appear on your statement as <strong>SWARMNEST</strong>. If you do not recognize a charge, email us before contacting your bank.</p>

<h3>Which Taxes Apply?</h3>
<p>See <a href="/tax/">Sales Tax Notes</a>.</p>

<h3>How Do I Correct or Remove a Directory Listing?</h3>
<p>See <a href="/directory-disclaimer/">Directory and Listing Disclaimer</a> and <a href="/takedown/">Takedown &amp; Corrections</a>.</p>
</Base>
